{"unit_id": "sub_0001", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:00:05,972", "end": "00:00:10,010"}, "text": "So obviously, all of us are very used to thinking about the fact", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0002", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:00:10,010", "end": "00:00:13,413"}, "text": "that we have to think about data analysis at the same time", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0003", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:00:13,413", "end": "00:00:16,116"}, "text": "that we're thinking through experimental design.", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0004", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:00:16,116", "end": "00:00:19,819"}, "text": "This is equally so, obviously, in the context", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0005", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:00:19,819", "end": "00:00:22,122"}, "text": "of computational modeling.", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0006", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:00:22,122", "end": "00:00:24,524"}, "text": "It's not impossible to take an experiment that", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0007", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:00:24,524", "end": "00:00:27,193"}, "text": "was designed not for computational modeling,", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0008", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:00:27,193", "end": "00:00:29,596"}, "text": "maybe for statistical analyzes, and develop", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0009", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:00:29,596", "end": "00:00:31,297"}, "text": "a computational model for it.", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0010", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:00:31,297", "end": "00:00:34,167"}, "text": "But a lot of the experimental considerations", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0011", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:00:34,167", "end": "00:00:37,070"}, "text": "that get optimized for statistical analyzes", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0012", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:00:37,070", "end": "00:00:41,608"}, "text": "don't necessarily translate perfectly to modeling.", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0013", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:00:41,608", "end": "00:00:45,412"}, "text": "And so I just wanted to bring this up.", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0014", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:00:45,412", "end": "00:00:50,617"}, "text": "So one of the things that really is", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0015", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:00:50,617", "end": "00:00:53,720"}, "text": "very different is that, in statistical analyzes,", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0016", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:00:53,720", "end": "00:00:57,557"}, "text": "often what you're looking at are values.", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0017", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:00:57,557", "end": "00:01:01,461"}, "text": "Are values higher or lower in some statistically significant", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0018", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:01:01,461", "end": "00:01:02,929"}, "text": "way?", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0019", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:01:02,929", "end": "00:01:06,399"}, "text": "And in the context of computational modeling,", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0020", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:01:06,399", "end": "00:01:09,502"}, "text": "what you're going to be doing is creating an ODE system.", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0021", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:01:09,502", "end": "00:01:11,204"}, "text": "So this is a dynamical system that's", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0022", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:01:11,204", "end": "00:01:13,406"}, "text": "going to have to evolve over time.", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0023", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:01:13,406", "end": "00:01:16,910"}, "text": "In order for you to create this system,", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0024", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:01:16,910", "end": "00:01:21,314"}, "text": "you're going to want to be able to test that the model is", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0025", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:01:21,314", "end": "00:01:22,348"}, "text": "actually accurate.", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0026", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:01:22,348", "end": "00:01:25,051"}, "text": "And so you want to think about it as, OK,", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0027", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:01:25,051", "end": "00:01:28,021"}, "text": "what ideally is my model producing?", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0028", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:01:28,021", "end": "00:01:31,291"}, "text": "And is my experiment setup up to actually test", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0029", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:01:31,291", "end": "00:01:33,593"}, "text": "that this model is correct?", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0030", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:01:33,593", "end": "00:01:36,696"}, "text": "So if you go back to this glucose insulin model", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0031", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:01:36,696", "end": "00:01:39,632"}, "text": "that we started with, you'll notice", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0032", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:01:39,632", "end": "00:01:43,169"}, "text": "that if you just simply think about values,", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0033", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:01:43,169", "end": "00:01:47,440"}, "text": "many of these different disorders", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0034", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:01:47,440", "end": "00:01:51,111"}, "text": "look potentially functionally identical, especially", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0035", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:01:51,111", "end": "00:01:53,880"}, "text": "if you consider just a single time point.", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0036", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:01:53,880", "end": "00:01:57,517"}, "text": "So if you're looking really just here,", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0037", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:01:57,517", "end": "00:02:00,253"}, "text": "these two are going to look very similar.", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0038", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:02:00,253", "end": "00:02:02,489"}, "text": "And it's only when you consider the dynamics", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0039", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:02:02,489", "end": "00:02:04,724"}, "text": "that these disorders start to look different.", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0040", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:02:04,724", "end": "00:02:08,394"}, "text": "So the first thing to mention is that, even though it's", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0041", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:02:08,394", "end": "00:02:10,864"}, "text": "very common to take a single measurement,", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0042", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:02:10,864", "end": "00:02:15,135"}, "text": "in the context of developing a computational neuroscience", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0043", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:02:15,135", "end": "00:02:17,370"}, "text": "model, what you're going to want are", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0044", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:02:17,370", "end": "00:02:22,709"}, "text": "to collect continuous measures ideally", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0045", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:02:22,709", "end": "00:02:25,979"}, "text": "over multiple components of the circuit.", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0046", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:02:25,979", "end": "00:02:29,082"}, "text": "So at the bare minimum, if you have something", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0047", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:02:29,082", "end": "00:02:31,284"}, "text": "that involves, let's say, a negative feedback loop,", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0048", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:02:31,284", "end": "00:02:33,553"}, "text": "you would definitely need to collect a signal", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0049", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:02:33,553", "end": "00:02:36,956"}, "text": "at both the excitatory and also the inhibitory components", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0050", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:02:36,956", "end": "00:02:38,758"}, "text": "of that negative feedback loop.", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0051", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:02:38,758", "end": "00:02:40,760"}, "text": "So I know this is challenging for people,", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0052", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:02:40,760", "end": "00:02:42,729"}, "text": "for example, who are doing electrophysiology", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0053", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:02:42,729", "end": "00:02:46,132"}, "text": "and for whom inserting an electrode is a very big deal.", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0054", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:02:46,132", "end": "00:02:48,234"}, "text": "But picking those areas strategically", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0055", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:02:48,234", "end": "00:02:50,370"}, "text": "becomes very important.", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0056", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:02:50,370", "end": "00:02:55,141"}, "text": "Even better if you can measure at more than two places", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0057", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:02:55,141", "end": "00:02:57,777"}, "text": "and actually as many places as possible,", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0058", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:02:57,777", "end": "00:03:00,880"}, "text": "the better the coverage you have over every one", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0059", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:03:00,880", "end": "00:03:05,451"}, "text": "of these components, the better you're", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0060", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:03:05,451", "end": "00:03:10,323"}, "text": "going to be able to resolve the dynamics and also causality.", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0061", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:03:10,323", "end": "00:03:13,626"}, "text": "The second point is--", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0062", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:03:13,626", "end": "00:03:14,627"}, "text": "well, OK.", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0063", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:03:14,627", "end": "00:03:18,965"}, "text": "So in line with this, you see that just measuring one value", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0064", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:03:18,965", "end": "00:03:22,068"}, "text": "here is actually not going to be enough to discriminate", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0065", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:03:22,068", "end": "00:03:23,203"}, "text": "between these disorders.", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0066", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:03:23,203", "end": "00:03:27,907"}, "text": "So you want, again, to measure across different components.", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0067", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:03:27,907", "end": "00:03:30,443"}, "text": "You want the dynamics.", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0068", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:03:30,443", "end": "00:03:34,647"}, "text": "And also, you need to consider that because you're", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0069", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:03:34,647", "end": "00:03:38,384"}, "text": "going to be focusing very deeply on the dynamics,", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0070", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:03:38,384", "end": "00:03:42,288"}, "text": "averaging time series can be potentially a problem", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0071", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:03:42,288", "end": "00:03:46,326"}, "text": "because you're going to wash out your dynamics to some degree.", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0072", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:03:46,326", "end": "00:03:48,628"}, "text": "And so for that reason, if possible,", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0073", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:03:48,628", "end": "00:03:52,799"}, "text": "you want to maximize your SNR, your Signal-to-Noise Ratio,", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0074", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:03:52,799", "end": "00:03:59,339"}, "text": "over long data rather than low SNR over short data.", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0075", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:03:59,339", "end": "00:04:01,975"}, "text": "And that actually goes against some of the principles that", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0076", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:04:01,975", "end": "00:04:05,245"}, "text": "are used in neuroimaging these huge data sets,", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0077", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:04:05,245", "end": "00:04:11,084"}, "text": "like UK Biobank, where you have very short resting state", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0078", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:04:11,084", "end": "00:04:15,288"}, "text": "data but over huge amounts of huge numbers of people.", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0079", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:04:15,288", "end": "00:04:18,725"}, "text": "And the assumption is that having lots of people", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0080", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:04:18,725", "end": "00:04:23,896"}, "text": "makes up for the fact that the data quality for each individual", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0081", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:04:23,896", "end": "00:04:25,031"}, "text": "is not as good.", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0082", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:04:28,635", "end": "00:04:30,970"}, "text": "The other thing you might want to consider", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0083", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:04:30,970", "end": "00:04:34,874"}, "text": "is that one of the advantages of computational modeling", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0084", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:04:34,874", "end": "00:04:38,077"}, "text": "is you can design what I call a critical experiment.", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0085", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:04:38,077", "end": "00:04:39,512"}, "text": "What you want to be able to do is", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0086", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:04:39,512", "end": "00:04:42,849"}, "text": "to set up your model to consider potentially competing", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0087", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:04:42,849", "end": "00:04:44,017"}, "text": "hypotheses.", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0088", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:04:44,017", "end": "00:04:47,253"}, "text": "So very often in neuroscience, there", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0089", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:04:47,253", "end": "00:04:53,860"}, "text": "are many competing ideas about how the circuit is set up,", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0090", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:04:53,860", "end": "00:04:55,528"}, "text": "what their functions are.", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0091", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:04:55,528", "end": "00:04:57,864"}, "text": "And the beauty of modeling is that you", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0092", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:04:57,864", "end": "00:05:01,167"}, "text": "can model each one of those competing hypotheses", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0093", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:05:01,167", "end": "00:05:05,038"}, "text": "and ask what their outputs would look like dynamically", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0094", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:05:05,038", "end": "00:05:09,676"}, "text": "and then see where those outputs maximally diverge", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0095", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:05:09,676", "end": "00:05:13,479"}, "text": "and then design the experiment to measure exactly where they", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0096", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:05:13,479", "end": "00:05:16,115"}, "text": "maximally diverge so that you can discriminate", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0097", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:05:16,115", "end": "00:05:18,184"}, "text": "between those competing hypotheses.", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0098", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:05:18,184", "end": "00:05:21,521"}, "text": "This is a very powerful way to use models.", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0099", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:05:21,521", "end": "00:05:25,058"}, "text": "So again, not even if you say, OK, I", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0100", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:05:25,058", "end": "00:05:27,226"}, "text": "don't have enough information about the system", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0101", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:05:27,226", "end": "00:05:30,630"}, "text": "to be sure about how this model is set up,", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0102", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:05:30,630", "end": "00:05:33,933"}, "text": "even being able to set up a provisional circuit with lots", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0103", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:05:33,933", "end": "00:05:36,736"}, "text": "of different ways of doing it, in principle,", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0104", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:05:36,736", "end": "00:05:38,571"}, "text": "you could look at all the combinatorial ways", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0105", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:05:38,571", "end": "00:05:41,607"}, "text": "that the circuit could be set up and ask what those outputs would", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0106", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:05:41,607", "end": "00:05:43,476"}, "text": "be and then let the data tell you", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0107", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:05:43,476", "end": "00:05:48,081"}, "text": "which of those configurations are compatible with the data", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0108", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:05:48,081", "end": "00:05:49,315"}, "text": "and which ones are not.", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0109", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:05:52,852", "end": "00:05:56,789"}, "text": "And then the other advantage of the model,", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0110", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:05:56,789", "end": "00:05:59,759"}, "text": "from that perspective, is that you can", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0111", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:05:59,759", "end": "00:06:01,928"}, "text": "perturb the circuit in silico.", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0112", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:06:01,928", "end": "00:06:04,097"}, "text": "You can ask what would happen if I", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0113", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:06:04,097", "end": "00:06:08,868"}, "text": "were to stimulate the circuit here versus here versus here.", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0114", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:06:08,868", "end": "00:06:10,837"}, "text": "How would it affect the dynamics?", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0115", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:06:10,837", "end": "00:06:14,340"}, "text": "So again, you can do these in-silico experiments", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0116", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:06:14,340", "end": "00:06:17,410"}, "text": "that then can create testable hypotheses which", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0117", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:06:17,410", "end": "00:06:18,444"}, "text": "can then be tested.", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0118", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:06:23,282", "end": "00:06:25,918"}, "text": "My last point is that if you're going", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0119", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:06:25,918", "end": "00:06:30,590"}, "text": "to take advantage of the multiscale capabilities", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0120", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:06:30,590", "end": "00:06:32,992"}, "text": "of neural blocks, you want to make sure", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0121", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:06:32,992", "end": "00:06:36,062"}, "text": "that you validate these by also collecting data", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0122", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:06:36,062", "end": "00:06:40,433"}, "text": "across multiple scales and ideally simultaneously", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0123", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:06:40,433", "end": "00:06:43,369"}, "text": "so that then you can develop the transfer functions that", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0124", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:06:43,369", "end": "00:06:47,407"}, "text": "allow you to ask, how do you get from the bottom layer", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0125", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:06:47,407", "end": "00:06:51,310"}, "text": "to the next layer to the next layer to the next layer?", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0126", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:06:51,310", "end": "00:06:54,547"}, "text": "So again, I'm not saying that these are easy experiments", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0127", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:06:54,547", "end": "00:06:58,284"}, "text": "to conduct, but it's something to consider if your ultimate aim", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0128", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "subtitle_srt", "loc": {"start": "00:06:58,284", "end": "00:07:04,056"}, "text": "is to create a rigorous model.", "required": true}
